\fs28 \cf0 Who I am\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 I'm Brent. ~24 years at a large tech company as a software engineer. Core skills: X++ (Microsoft Dynamics 365 F&O), SCM automation, C#. Job security has been wobbly due to recurring layoffs, so I'm exploring side income and career diversification. I'm a planner \'97 I think ahead, and I push back when advice feels too cautious.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 My wife Toni\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 She's smart, runs/helps run rodeos, and is now my de facto product designer for this project. She's a Windows user. When she gives feedback on the workbook, I take it seriously \'97 she's the closest thing I have to a real user.\
