\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 The project\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 A team roping management tool for rodeo producers. Started as a "help Toni avoid doing the draw by hand" Excel favor and has evolved into a real product idea.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

